            <div class="chaptertitle section">
    
    <link data-link-clientlib rel="stylesheet" href="https://wcmassets.kbc.be/etc.clientlibs/kbc/components/websites/chaptertitle.min.ACSHASH0a16007a72a96cfedba49c7736ce9a50.css" type="text/css">





<h1 class="alpha chaptertitle__text default-margin chaptertitle__text--left" data-component-type="chaptertitle">KBC in the debt capital markets</h1>


</div>
<div class="visualusp section">
<div class="visual-usp visual-usp--left" data-component-type="visual-usp">

    <div style="background-image: url('https://wcmassets.kbc.be/content/dam/kbccom/hero/20251017-man-afspranning-%20880x400.jpg/_jcr_content/renditions/cq5dam.web.480.9999.jpeg.cdn.res/last-modified/1760691949309/cq5dam.web.480.9999.jpeg');" title="Entrepreneur walking outdoors talking on mobile phone" class="visual-usp__image visual-usp__image--vertical-top visual-usp__image--horizontal-center" data-responsive-background data-backgroundLargest="https://wcmassets.kbc.be/content/dam/kbccom/hero/20251017-man-afspranning-%20880x400.jpg/_jcr_content/renditions/cq5dam.web.2000.9999.jpeg.cdn.res/last-modified/1760691949309/cq5dam.web.2000.9999.jpeg" data-backgroundLarge="https://wcmassets.kbc.be/content/dam/kbccom/hero/20251017-man-afspranning-%20880x400.jpg/_jcr_content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1200.9999.jpeg.cdn.res/last-modified/1760691949309/cq5dam.web.1200.9999.jpeg" data-backgroundMedium="https://wcmassets.kbc.be/content/dam/kbccom/hero/20251017-man-afspranning-%20880x400.jpg/_jcr_content/renditions/cq5dam.web.960.9999.jpeg.cdn.res/last-modified/1760691949309/cq5dam.web.960.9999.jpeg" data-backgroundSmall="https://wcmassets.kbc.be/content/dam/kbccom/hero/20251017-man-afspranning-%20880x400.jpg/_jcr_content/renditions/cq5dam.web.680.9999.jpeg.cdn.res/last-modified/1760691949309/cq5dam.web.680.9999.jpeg">
        <img class="sr-only" src="https://wcmassets.kbc.be/content/dam/kbccom/hero/20251017-man-afspranning-%20880x400.jpg/_jcr_content/renditions/cq5dam.web.480.9999.jpeg.cdn.res/last-modified/1760691949309/cq5dam.web.480.9999.jpeg" alt="Entrepreneur walking outdoors talking on mobile phone" loading="lazy"/>
    </div>
    
    <div class="visual-usp__content">
        <div class="chaptertitle visual-usp__content__title-wrapper">
            
        </div>
        <div class="visual-usp__content__text visual-usp__content__text--default"><p>The KBC group is a frequent issuer in the debt capital markets. The group and its subsidiaries have issued a variety of bonds with senior and subordinated status in many different currencies. Bond holders wishing to exercise rights attached to their bonds can contact KBC Bank NV.</p>
</div>
        <div class="visual-usp__button-group">
            <div>
    
    


<div data-component-type="button-group" class="aem-cta-btngroup  aem-cta-btngroup--left">
    
    
    
</div>
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>




    
    <link data-link-clientlib rel="stylesheet" href="https://wcmassets.kbc.be/etc.clientlibs/kbc/components/websites/visual-usp.min.ACSHASH044955bbe06a61ebb7a6fdf0b1e8aa9c.css" type="text/css">


</div>
<div class="textimage parbase section"><div class="text-image  text-image--left default-margin " data-component-type="textimage">

    

    
    
    <div class="text-image__text"><p>The main debt issuances and programmes are listed aside, by issuer (KBC Group, KBC Bank or KBC IFIMA).</p>
<p>Our policy is to issue all MREL instruments (AT1, T2, senior holdco) from KBC group level as a single point of entry (in line with our resolution strategy), which is the highest level of consolidation, and down-stream in the appropriate format to KBC Bank and KBC Insurance.<br />
KBC Bank issues covered bonds and KBC IFIMA issues retail and wholesale debt instruments. All debt obligations of KBC IFIMA are unconditionally and irrevocably guaranteed by KBC Bank.<br />
</p>
<p><a class="download-link" href="https://wcmassets.kbc.be/content/dam/kbccom/doc/investor-relations/Results/2q2026/2q2026-debt-presentation.pdf.cdn.res/last-modified/1785941139650/2q2026-debt-presentation.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Most recent debt presentation</a></p>
<p> </p></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="chaptertitle section">
    
    





<h2 class="beta chaptertitle__text default-margin chaptertitle__text--left" data-component-type="chaptertitle">Mid-term funding maturities</h2>


</div>
